# Variant: on-demand: [on_demand_wrapping: true]

## Assets

### main.js

```js
// value.js
const VALUE = { value: "entry" };

// main.js
const LOCAL = "local";
const load = () => import("./shared.js").then((module) => module.FORWARDED);

export { LOCAL, VALUE, load };

```

